  "details": "Currently we can only adjust one float using the radial control in the avatar menu.\n\nIt would be nice to be able to add multiple float values that would be changed at the same time using one radial in the menu.\n\nExample use :\n\nYou have separate hue shifts and you want to add a control that would override and control all of them.\n\nAdding a possibility of adding more than 1 float to a radial control in the avatar menu would solve this problem.\n\nThere could be + and - buttons in the marked position on the screenshot, for example.",
